@architecture.clean

Purpose:
  Entities, use cases, interface adapters, frameworks.

Owns: references\architecture\clean.sdd
UseWhen:
  - enterprise scale
  - strict dependency rules required
  - long-lived codebase

AvoidWhen:
  - small project
  - rapid prototyping

Why:
  Enforces strict dependency direction inward.

TradeOffs:
  + Clear separation of concerns
  + Enterprise grade
  - More boilerplate
  - Steeper learning curve

Related:
  @architecture.hexagonal
  @architecture.layered

Examples:
  @project.core-banking
  @project.enterprise

State: +
